#: rsc/fr.dwightstudio.TypeForMe.metainfo.xml:25
msgid ""
"Type for Me is a simple utility that types the content of your clipboard "
"instead of pasting it. It allows you to use your clipboard anywhere, even in "
"virtual machines or remote sessions that do not support pasting."
msgstr ""

#: rsc/fr.dwightstudio.TypeForMe.metainfo.xml:27
msgid ""
"It relies on the Remote Desktop and Global Shortcuts portals of modern "
"Wayland desktops: press the shortcut and the clipboard is typed into the "
"focused window."
msgstr ""

